{
 "_note": "Corrected script (ASR typos fixed against the source subtitles). One line on screen at a time. Optional per line: x/y centre (or edge with align), size, hl = keyword (gold, or grey with hlc), emph = big gold line, fx = fog | lost | petal | bloom | walk (meaning-driven effects). vertical = vertical text; hlc = grey | red | green; fx also: mayfly heavy cage fade wake dust clone rain trudge scratch float.",
 "end": 86.9,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "人生不可能每一步都是正确的",
   "size": 92
  },
  {
   "text": "选错了就选错了",
   "x": 330,
   "y": 470,
   "align": "left",
   "size": 118
  },
  {
   "text": "不要一遍一遍地后悔",
   "x": 1600,
   "y": 610,
   "align": "right",
   "size": 86
  },
  {
   "text": "也不要总是责怪从前的自己",
   "size": 78,
   "hl": "从前的自己",
   "hlc": "grey"
  },
  {
   "text": "因为他当时站在雾里",
   "y": 500,
   "size": 96,
   "fx": "fog"
  },
  {
   "text": "也很迷茫",
   "size": 170,
   "fx": "lost"
  },
  {
   "text": "所以不必回头看",
   "y": 600,
   "size": 88
  },
  {
   "text": "蔷薇今年谢了",
   "hl": "蔷薇",
   "y": 380,
   "size": 110,
   "fx": "petal"
  },
  {
   "text": "明年还会再开",
   "y": 690,
   "size": 110,
   "fx": "bloom",
   "hl": "再开"
  },
  {
   "text": "总会有人陪你看不同的风景",
   "hl": "风景",
   "size": 82
  },
  {
   "text": "勇敢点，向前走",
   "emph": true,
   "fx": "walk",
   "walk": "向前走"
  },
  {
   "text": "有的人一生追求精彩而活",
   "hl": "精彩",
   "y": 480,
   "size": 88
  },
  {
   "text": "即使寿弱蜉蝣",
   "size": 62,
   "fx": "mayfly",
   "y": 560
  },
  {
   "text": "仍旧痴迷其中滋味",
   "size": 92
  },
  {
   "text": "而有的人寿比冥灵",
   "size": 126,
   "fx": "heavy"
  },
  {
   "text": "却终岁不得自由",
   "hl": "自由",
   "size": 96,
   "fx": "cage"
  },
  {
   "text": "虚度自己的光阴年华",
   "size": 88,
   "fx": "fade"
  },
  {
   "text": "终究在最后一刻翻然醒悟",
   "hl": "醒悟",
   "size": 86,
   "fx": "wake"
  },
  {
   "text": "步入红尘",
   "size": 160,
   "hl": "红尘",
   "hlc": "red"
  },
  {
   "text": "却大限将至",
   "size": 110,
   "y": 520
  },
  {
   "text": "辞别了人间",
   "size": 104,
   "fx": "dust"
  },
  {
   "text": "然而身在庐山之外",
   "size": 74,
   "vertical": true,
   "x": 1540,
   "y": 470
  },
  {
   "text": "又岂能知晓山中人之想呢",
   "size": 66,
   "vertical": true,
   "x": 380,
   "y": 500
  },
  {
   "text": "我清楚地知道",
   "size": 84
  },
  {
   "text": "人与人的路是不可复制的",
   "emph": true,
   "fx": "clone",
   "size": 112
  },
  {
   "text": "我走在自己的人生路上",
   "size": 88
  },
  {
   "text": "哪怕路途的风雨再大",
   "hl": "风雨",
   "fx": "rain",
   "size": 92
  },
  {
   "text": "大到我步履维艰",
   "fx": "trudge",
   "size": 96,
   "x": 860
  },
  {
   "text": "哪怕荆棘丛生",
   "hl": "荆棘",
   "size": 104,
   "hlc": "red"
  },
  {
   "text": "刺得我伤痕遍布",
   "fx": "scratch",
   "size": 98
  },
  {
   "text": "我也仍痴痴笑笑",
   "size": 92
  },
  {
   "text": "我体会此中滋味",
   "size": 92
  },
  {
   "text": "我相信独游的小船",
   "fx": "float",
   "size": 90,
   "y": 430
  },
  {
   "text": "终有一天会看到两岸群山青翠",
   "hl": "青翠",
   "size": 80,
   "hlc": "green",
   "y": 470
  },
  {
   "text": "虫鸟同鸣",
   "emph": true,
   "size": 150,
   "y": 470
  }
 ],
